The Volkswagen Transporter T6.1 T32 Highline is a well-equipped, high-payload variant of VW's popular medium van. It combines the increased carrying capacity of the T32 designation (3200kg GVW) with the enhanced features and comfort of the Highline trim level. This makes it suitable for demanding commercial use or as a premium base for conversions.

